1
00:00:00,762 --> 00:00:03,092
(Howard:)Sheldon, these look great.

2
00:00:03,264 --> 00:00:05,974
(Sheldon:)l mean,
they're like magnificent little crowns...

3
00:00:06,142 --> 00:00:08,852
(Howard:)...to hang
over my magnificent little jewels.

4
00:00:10,772 --> 00:00:12,482
How did you get them so shiny?

5
00:00:12,649 --> 00:00:15,069
Oh, I buffed them with Turtle wax.

6
00:00:15,235 --> 00:00:17,315
(Sheldon:)The man down at Pep Boys
says from now on...

7
00:00:17,487 --> 00:00:20,407
(Sheldon:)...the urine should just bead up
and roll right off.

8
00:00:21,199 --> 00:00:24,119
(Howard:)Way to go the extra mile.
Your Mee-Maw would be proud.

9
00:00:24,285 --> 00:00:26,825
(Sheldon:)My Mee-Maw
must never know of this.

10
00:00:27,455 --> 00:00:29,625
(Sheldon:)Now will you give
Professor Hawking my paper?

11
00:00:29,791 --> 00:00:32,001
(Howard:)Oh, my dear boy, no. Okay.

12
00:00:33,419 --> 00:00:39,009
(Howard:)Next, this is a sexy French maid
costume I bought for Bernadette.

13
00:00:39,175 --> 00:00:40,965
l thought it might spice things up...

14
00:00:41,135 --> 00:00:43,885
(Howard:)...and get her to dust my room
at the same time, heh...

15
00:00:44,055 --> 00:00:46,845
(Howard:)...but I was wrong and really wrong.

16
00:00:47,475 --> 00:00:49,055
(Sheldon:)You want me to return it for you?

